---
title: OAuth Authentication Flow
---
flowchart TD
    A[User visits /login] --> B[Click 'Sign in with Google']
    B --> C[Redirect to /auth/better]
    C --> D[Generate state token]
    D --> E[Redirect to Google OAuth]
    E --> F{User authorizes?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Google redirects to /auth/callback]
    F -->|No| H[Return to login]
    G --> I[Exchange code for tokens]
    I --> J[Fetch user info from Google]
    J --> K[Create session in memory]
    K --> L[Set session_id cookie]
    L --> M[Redirect to frontend]
